### 3.2 记忆化搜索实现
```php
function fibMemoization($n, &$memo) {
    if ($n in $memo) return $memo[$n];

    if ($n <= 1) return $n;

    $memo[$n] = fibMemoization($n-1, $memo) + fibMemoization($n-2, $memo);
    return $memo[$n];
}

// 调用示例
$memo = [];
echo fibMemoization(10, $memo); // 输出55
```

